          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Turn up the Halloween music and get ready for a spooky dance party! This freeze dance audio is filled with Halloween-themed instrumental songs featuring ghosts, skeletons, haunted melodies and plenty of fun beats to dance along with.The game is easy: dance while the music is playing and FREEZE whenever it stops! Hold your silliest, spookiest or craziest pose until the music starts again, then jump right back in.With a mix of upbeat songs and slower, suspenseful tunes, kids never know when the next freeze is coming. Perfect for Halloween parties, classroom movement breaks or dancing around the living room!Run Time: 25 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 03c9b94361b1eb84679c9913fb71a63695cc573d0be0f39960d814d3f7066e86",
